{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53385","headline":"答顺宗皇帝问 二 · 如满","name":"答顺宗皇帝问 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛体本无爲，迷情妄分别。\n法身等虚空，未曾有生灭。\n有缘佛出世，无缘佛入灭。\n处处化衆生，犹如水中月。\n非常亦非灭。\n生亦未曾生，灭亦未曾灭。\n了见无心处，自然无法说。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"如满","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}